ios/generated
android/generated

# React Native Nitro Modules
nitrogen/

# Internal working documents — deliberately not published.
#
# SPEC.md is the contract this module is built against, TODO.md is the
# device-verification log, and docs/customer-onboarding.md is written for us rather
# than for a customer. They record tenant-specific findings, measurements against a
# real tenant and decisions that are ours, not the library's public interface — which
# lives in the README and the documentation site.
SPEC.md
TODO.md
docs/customer-onboarding.md
